  "title": {
    "zh": "紧急工单插队",
    "en": "Priority Dispatch Shuttle"
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "批次边界 · 双队列 · 保留到达顺序",
    "en": "Batch boundaries · Two queues · Stable arrival order"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "机器人一次收到多批移动工单。每张工单写着优先级和一个方向。按批次处理，每批先执行所有 urgent，再执行 standard；同一优先级仍按到达顺序。每次移动的方向须从队头取出，最后在出口取走调度档案。三张地图的工单各不相同。",
    "en": "The shuttle receives multiple batches of movement orders. Each order has a priority and a direction. Process batches in order. In each batch, execute all urgent orders before standard ones, keeping arrival order within each priority. Each move must use a direction taken from the front of a queue. Pick up the dispatch archive at the exit. The three maps have different orders."
  },
